        "language": "english",
        "review": "Honestly, this isn't very good. At face value, it looked like a copy of \"Milk inside of a bag inside of a bag\", but it was cheap so I decided to give it  a try anyway.\n\nYeah, it's pretty much just a copy of that, but worse. The writing is pretty poor, and the english translation is awful. It also doesn't even try to have any sort of point to it. Milk Inside of a Bag was about a girl's struggle against her own mental illness. This game barely touches on that. It brings up medication and has the player take the role of 'the voice in her head' but only on a surface level. It's like the dev tried to copy the surface level aspects of the story but didn't understand why each story element was actually there.\n\nThis just comes off as a cheap knockoff that misses everything that made the original interesting.",
